# Contributing

## Ethical Requirements
All contributions must be for **defensive security and educational purposes only**.
No offensive functionality (live credential dumping, network scanning, etc.) will be accepted.

## Adding Detection Rules
- Every new wordlist strategy must include a comment explaining real-world usage
- Every new hash algorithm must include its crack speed and a recommendation note
- Follow PEP 8 — run `flake8 toolkit.py` before submitting

## Reporting Issues
Open a GitHub issue with: description, Python version, OS, reproduction steps.

## Areas Needing Help
- Argon2 / scrypt support via `passlib`
- YAML-configurable policy rules
- Unit tests (`pytest`) for each module
- Password breach database integration (HaveIBeenPwned API)